      "path": "src/ui/cockpit/replay/overlay.tsx",
      "content": "Focusable descendants of the visible summary are incorrectly excluded for closed details. For example, with `\u003cdetails\u003e\u003csummary\u003eTable \u003ca href=\"/help\"\u003eHelp\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/summary\u003e…\u003c/details\u003e` as the last content, the link remains tabbable in the browser, but this filter treats the summary as the last stop. Tab therefore wraps before reaching Help, and Shift+Tab from Close skips it too. Allow elements contained in the closed details' first summary, not just the summary element itself, and add a regression test for that case.",
      "existing_code": "    if (p instanceof HTMLDetailsElement \u0026\u0026 !p.open \u0026\u0026 !(el.tagName === 'SUMMARY' \u0026\u0026 el.parentElement === p)) return false;",
