      "content": "The unconditional `summary` selector also includes `\u003csummary tabIndex={-1}\u003e`, although it is explicitly excluded from sequential keyboard navigation. If that summary is the last child control, Shift+Tab from Close now moves focus to it instead of the preceding tabbable control. Exclude negative-tabindex summaries as well, and add a regression test for this case.",
      "existing_code": "const FOCUSABLE = 'summary, a[href], button:not([disabled]), input:not([disabled]), select:not([disabled]), textarea:not([disabled]), [tabindex]:not([tabindex=\"-1\"])';",
